  "description": "ASP.NET Core integration for Lyo.Authentication. Provides an opaque-token authentication handler, a Lyo-JWT authentication handler, and a \"LyoBearer\" policy scheme that sniffs the credential prefix to dispatch between them. Adds the ScopeAuthorizationPolicyProvider for fine-grained `scope:foo.bar` policies and the `/.well-known/jwks.json` endpoint.",
